{%- comment -%}
  House Codes — the Rumaya-inspired scroll principle (large visual rooms + a central chapter title
  that automatically changes as the user scrolls from one room into the next), translated into an
  entirely original CAVIERA experience. NOT a copy of Rumaya's branding, imagery, layout, or rounded
  visual language — see assets/caviera-home.css for the architectural (near-square-edged) treatment.

  Four House Codes, from the existing official CAVIERA House pillars (sections/caviera-house-
  statement.liquid) — same names, same approved short copy, not invented here: Rarity, Precision,
  Ritual, Longevity.

  ARCHITECTURE (deliberately NOT another tall pin-wrapper like the hero/Edition I): the four rooms
  are plain, full-bleed sections stacked in NORMAL document flow (.caviera-house-codes__rooms,
  85vh each, contiguous — no gaps between them, so the image handoff the brief asks for is simply
  the natural, contiguous result of stacking, not a choreographed transform). A sticky central
  overlay (.caviera-house-codes__overlay) is a SIBLING of the rooms wrapper, using the exact same
  "two sticky siblings + a negative top-margin equal to the other's height" technique already
  proven in the hero and Edition I (see the comment above .caviera-hero in caviera-home.css) — it
  stays centred in the viewport for the entire scroll distance of the four rooms, then releases
  the instant they end. assets/caviera-house-codes.js uses one IntersectionObserver (same pattern
  as caviera-object-focus.js/caviera-packaging-ritual.js) to decide which room is nearest the
  reading centre and writes data-active-code onto the stage; CSS crossfades the matching overlay
  frame in response — no scroll-jacking, no wheel interception, no forced scroll position.

  ACCESSIBILITY / NO-JS / REDUCED-MOTION: every room ALSO carries its own real, always-visible
  semantic heading + copy (.caviera-house-codes__room-caption) — not a screen-reader-only duplicate.
  The sticky overlay is aria-hidden and is the one thing hidden outright under prefers-reduced-
  motion and below the section's own motion breakpoint (900px) — at which point the per-room
  captions are already the whole story, so nothing is lost, nothing needs a fallback path of its
  own. Below 900px each room is simply its own vertical image chapter, exactly per brief.

  IMAGE FALLBACKS (Theme Editor image_picker per room; every fallback below is a deliberate CAVIERA
  composition, never a placeholder rectangle):
    Rarity     — the bundled campaign photograph (assets/15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png), the same
                 bundled default the hero/Edition I use, cropped tight and off-centre here for a
                 "rare presence in negative space" reading distinct from its use elsewhere.
    Precision  — an original CSS-only faceted/geometric composition (nested rotated Rhodium-edged
                 squares suggesting a cut stone) — no photograph exists yet for a real diamond/
                 setting macro.
    Ritual     — an original CSS-only material study reusing the same "Obsidian outer → Cinnabar
                 case → Warm Bone interior" nested-panel language already established in Packaging
                 ritual's own no-photo fallback — thematically exact for an "opening" moment.
    Longevity  — the official House Seal (bundled artwork), presented large and ceremonial —
                 "maker's mark / provenance" is explicitly what the Seal already represents
                 elsewhere in this theme (see Packaging ritual's "Unseal" step, Maker's Mark
                 section).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rarity_img = section.settings.rarity_image
  assign precision_img = section.settings.precision_image
  assign ritual_img = section.settings.ritual_image
  assign longevity_img = section.settings.longevity_image
  assign bundled_file = '15_oryx_necklace_on_model.png'

  assign rarity_derived = false
  if rarity_img == blank
    assign rarity_derived = true
  endif
  assign precision_derived = false
  if precision_img == blank
    assign precision_derived = true
  endif
  assign ritual_derived = false
  if ritual_img == blank
    assign ritual_derived = true
  endif
  assign longevity_derived = false
  if longevity_img == blank
    assign longevity_derived = true
  endif
-%}
<section class="caviera-section caviera-house-codes" data-scheme="obsidian">
  <div class="container container--narrow caviera-house-codes__head" data-reveal>
    {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}<span class="eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    {%- if section.settings.heading != blank -%}<h2 class="heading-h1">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>{%- endif -%}
  </div>

  <div class="caviera-house-codes__stage" data-caviera-house-codes data-active-code="rarity">
    <div class="caviera-house-codes__rooms">
      {%- comment -%} 01 RARITY {%- endcomment -%}
      <article class="caviera-house-codes__room" data-house-code="rarity" data-index="0" data-derived="{{ rarity_derived }}">
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-media">
          {%- if rarity_img != blank -%}
            <img
              src="{{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
              srcset="{{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ rarity_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
              sizes="100vw"
              width="{{ rarity_img.width }}" height="{{ rarity_img.height }}"
              alt="{{ rarity_img.alt | default: 'Rarity' | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            <img src="{{ bundled_file | asset_url }}" width="521" height="358" alt="Rarity" loading="lazy">
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-caption">
          <span class="label">01</span>
          <h3>Rarity</h3>
          {%- if section.settings.rarity_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.rarity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </article>

      {%- comment -%} 02 PRECISION — no photograph exists yet; an original CAVIERA geometric field. {%- endcomment -%}
      <article class="caviera-house-codes__room" data-house-code="precision" data-index="1" data-derived="{{ precision_derived }}">
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-media">
          {%- if precision_img != blank -%}
            <img
              src="{{ precision_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
              srcset="{{ precision_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ precision_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ precision_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
              sizes="100vw"
              width="{{ precision_img.width }}" height="{{ precision_img.height }}"
              alt="{{ precision_img.alt | default: 'Precision' | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="caviera-house-codes__facet-field" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="caviera-house-codes__facet"></span>
              <span class="caviera-house-codes__facet"></span>
              <span class="caviera-house-codes__facet"></span>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-caption">
          <span class="label">02</span>
          <h3>Precision</h3>
          {%- if section.settings.precision_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.precision_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </article>

      {%- comment -%} 03 RITUAL — no packaging photograph exists yet; reuses Packaging ritual's own nested-panel material study. {%- endcomment -%}
      <article class="caviera-house-codes__room" data-house-code="ritual" data-index="2" data-derived="{{ ritual_derived }}">
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-media">
          {%- if ritual_img != blank -%}
            <img
              src="{{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
              srcset="{{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ ritual_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
              sizes="100vw"
              width="{{ ritual_img.width }}" height="{{ ritual_img.height }}"
              alt="{{ ritual_img.alt | default: 'Ritual' | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="caviera-house-codes__ritual-field" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="caviera-house-codes__ritual-panel" data-panel="cinnabar"></span>
              <span class="caviera-house-codes__ritual-panel" data-panel="bone"></span>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-caption">
          <span class="label">03</span>
          <h3>Ritual</h3>
          {%- if section.settings.ritual_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.ritual_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </article>

      {%- comment -%} 04 LONGEVITY — the official House Seal: provenance/maker's mark, already its established role elsewhere in this theme. {%- endcomment -%}
      <article class="caviera-house-codes__room" data-house-code="longevity" data-index="3" data-derived="{{ longevity_derived }}">
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-media">
          {%- if longevity_img != blank -%}
            <img
              src="{{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }}"
              srcset="{{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 800 }} 800w, {{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 1600 }} 1600w, {{ longevity_img | image_url: width: 2200 }} 2200w"
              sizes="100vw"
              width="{{ longevity_img.width }}" height="{{ longevity_img.height }}"
              alt="{{ longevity_img.alt | default: 'Longevity' | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          {%- else -%}
            <div class="caviera-house-codes__seal-field" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- render 'caviera-house-seal', mode: 'dark', width: 220, alt: '' -%}
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__room-caption">
          <span class="label">04</span>
          <h3>Longevity</h3>
          {%- if section.settings.longevity_copy != blank -%}<p>{{ section.settings.longevity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      Sticky central overlay — decorative duplicate of the per-room captions above, so it can be
      safely aria-hidden and hidden outright under reduced motion / below 900px without losing any
      information. Every frame renders unconditionally (no [data-reveal], no JS dependency) so the
      Rarity frame is what's on screen even if assets/caviera-house-codes.js never runs at all.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-inner">
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-eyebrow">The House Codes</span>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-frame" data-code="rarity">
          <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-number">01</span>
          <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Rarity</p>
          {%- if section.settings.rarity_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.rarity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-frame" data-code="precision">
          <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-number">02</span>
          <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Precision</p>
          {%- if section.settings.precision_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.precision_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-frame" data-code="ritual">
          <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-number">03</span>
          <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Ritual</p>
          {%- if section.settings.ritual_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.ritual_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <div class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-frame" data-code="longevity">
          <span class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-number">04</span>
          <p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-title">Longevity</p>
          {%- if section.settings.longevity_copy != blank -%}<p class="caviera-house-codes__overlay-copy">{{ section.settings.longevity_copy }}</p>{%- endif -%}
        </div>
        <span class="caviera-house-codes__line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script src="{{ 'caviera-house-codes.js' | asset_url }}" defer="defer"></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "House Codes",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Label", "default": "The House Codes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Four principles, one House." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "01 Rarity" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "rarity_image", "label": "Rarity image", "info": "Jewellery isolated in strong negative space — unusual composition, object-led, not a styled lifestyle shot. Falls back to a bundled CAVIERA image when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rarity_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Unexpected, never ornamental for its own sake." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "02 Precision" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "precision_image", "label": "Precision image", "info": "Diamond macro, setting detail, or faceted/geometric construction. Falls back to an original CAVIERA geometric field when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "precision_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Every cut, line and word earns its place." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "03 Ritual" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "ritual_image", "label": "Ritual image", "info": "Packaging reveal, House Seal, or an opening gesture. Falls back to an original CAVIERA material study when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "ritual_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Discovery is paced, tactile and memorable." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "04 Longevity" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "longevity_image", "label": "Longevity image", "info": "A gold object, maker's mark, or provenance detail. Falls back to the official House Seal when left blank." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "longevity_copy", "label": "Short line", "default": "Objects and identity are made to age well." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "House Codes" }],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["index"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}
